=== em maint binpkg verify ===
Check each indexed binpkg's size/MD5/SHA1 against the file on disk

Usage: em maint binpkg verify [--fix] [--require-signature]

Flags:
      --fix                 Quarantine corrupt containers (rename to `.corrupt`)
                            and drop missing/corrupt entries from the index by
                            regenerating it.
      --require-signature   Reject a container with no OpenPGP signature at all
                            (matches FEATURES=binpkg-request-signature); with a
                            verify keyring present (`em maint binpkg
                            gpg-import`), signatures are always
                            cryptographically checked regardless of this flag.
  -h, --help                Print help

Global flags:
      --color <WHEN>
                            [possible values: auto, always, never]
