select binutils:
Select the active binutils profile (binutils-config/eselect binutils workalike)


select clang:
Select the active LLVM/clang slot


select compiler:
Select the active compiler profile (gcc-config/eselect gcc workalike)


select glsa:
Check/fix Gentoo Linux Security Advisories (glsa-check workalike)


select linker:
Select the active linker profile


select mirrors:
Manage Gentoo distfile mirrors (mirrorselect workalike)


select news:
Read/manage GLEP 42 news items (eselect news workalike)


select pkgconf:
Select the pkg-config backend and create the <CTARGET>-pkg-config wrapper


select profile:
Select the system/sysroot profile (cross-aware)


select repository:
Manage local repositories (overlays)

